{
  "description": "SPEC §5: hard rules for one tool call. expected.rule is 'deny', 'approve' or null (no hard rule applies). expected.class names the deciding path class (guard, hostConfig, hostSkills, hostState, secrets, secretFile, persistence), 'command' for a §5.3 command pattern, or 'tool' for a §5.2 tool rule; omitted when rule is null. 'tainted' defaults to false. Environment: vectors/environment.json. A shell token is path-like when it contains '/', starts with '~' or '.', or matches a secretFile name; tokens are split at whitespace and the characters ; | & < > ( ) ' \" ` and '='.",
